# Default list with header: pull-to-refresh that finds new posts, and prepends racing a refresh.
route Feed
latency 250,700
wait 2
mark publish-then-pull
press 296 80
wait 1.5
pan 200 250 0 450 700
wait 4
mark pull-then-publish-burst
pan 200 250 0 450 700
repeat 3 press 296 80
wait 5
mark scrolled-pull
pan 200 700 0 -300 400
wait 1
pan 200 250 0 450 700
wait 4
